12. 🔴 Failure handling

We need a proper enterprise failure mechanism:

Test failure
    ↓
ITestListener
    ↓
Capture screenshot
    ↓
Capture exception
    ↓
Attach to Extent
    ↓
Capture video
    ↓
Logging

Currently some of this exists in the test code, but I would move failure handling toward a listener rather than putting try/catch into every test.

Instead of every test having:

try {
   ...
} catch (...) {
   ...
}

I'd prefer:

Test
  ↓
Listener
  ↓
Failure handling

That is much more scalable.

